OL,3,AUS diesel prices hit an all-time-high
OL,4,
OL,5,FDrivers in the US are paying more than
OL,6,Fever for diesel at the pump as the
OL,7,FUS-Israel war with Iran continues to
OL,8,Fhit Americans' wallets.
OL,10,FIn the US, diesel is mostly used by
OL,11,Fcommercial vehicles, such as trucks,
OL,12,Ftrains, boats, buses, farming vehicles
OL,13,Fand construction vehicles.
OL,15,FThe average price for one gallon of
OL,16,Fdiesel in the US has hit $5.85,
OL,17,Fcompared to an average of $3.71 a year
OL,18,Fago and above the previous high
OL,19,Ffollowing Russia's full-scale invasion
OL,20,Fof Ukraine, according to the American
OL,21,FAutomobile Association (AAA).
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
